                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Seems I am the first one to review this. So the gameplay is like this: You move on a map on small circles. Every few fields there are special fileds with events or fights. A fight is turn based and you use physical or magic attacks. You can gain levels and this inceases your stats. Also your stats are increased by -what I call- Karma-runes. All  together it is more like a board game. The graphics are beautiful and high resolution.\nThe story is told similar to a visual novel.\nI enjoy it so far.",
